Problem
Create branch xfusion in /usr/src/kodekloudrepos/official, copy index.html, commit, merge to master, push both branches.

Solution
bash
cd /usr/src/kodekloudrepos/official
git checkout master
git pull origin master
git checkout -b xfusion
cp /tmp/index.html .
git add index.html
git commit -m "Add index.html from /tmp to xfusion branch"
git checkout master
git merge xfusion
git push origin master
git push origin xfusion
